{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>現代生活節奏快速，許多人苦於無法持之以恆地養成好習慣，或擺脫壞習慣，這款《Habit Tracker Widget》正是為了解決您的困擾而生，今天更限時免費開放下載。它是一款直觀且功能強大的應用程式，無論您是想建立晨間例行清單、保持健身習慣，或是單純提醒自己多喝水，都能透過其便利的桌面小工具，輕鬆將習慣融入日常，讓目標達成不再是遙不可及的夢想。</p>\n\n<h2>桌面小工具一鍵打卡</h2>\n<p>這款 App 支援在桌面或鎖定螢幕新增無限量小工具，輕觸即可完成每日打卡，無需開啟應用程式。它提供彈性習慣規劃，可自訂色彩與樣式，無論晨間清單或循環習慣都能完美融入生活。透過連擊紀錄、目標與進度追蹤，有效激勵您養成長期正向習慣，持之以恆。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-56-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-57-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-58-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-59-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-60-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-61-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Habit Tracker Widget</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-22T22:47:57.510606+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":366,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}